WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.705
Experience the entire visa application lifecycle through our AI-powered Traveler Portal

00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:17.211
The first step is simply choosing your destination. Today we'll select Malaysia

00:00:17.211 --> 00:00:18.239
as an example.

00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:22.913
Your AI assistant greets you and confirms your location

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:29.525
If the detected location isn't correct, simply select 'No, different country'

00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:33.582
and choose your current country of residence.

00:00:35.175 --> 00:00:38.992
Simply enter your phone number and continue. We'll use it to keep

00:00:38.992 --> 00:00:41.855
you informed at every stage of your visa application.

00:00:43.554 --> 00:00:48.097
Use the language selector to continue the application in your preferred language.

00:00:49.684 --> 00:00:53.124
Travellers can choose their preferred currency at any time.

00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:58.601
Get assistance from our visa experts without leaving your application.

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:03.967
Adjust the number of adults and children included in your application.

00:01:05.617 --> 00:01:09.304
Review all available visa options and choose the one that best fits

00:01:09.304 --> 00:01:10.226
your travel needs.

00:01:11.849 --> 00:01:15.860
Following this, click the Details button to view comprehensive visa requirements.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:27.231
Next, click Register to create your account and continue your application.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.408
Already have an account? Click Log in to sign in

00:01:33.227 --> 00:01:36.992
Once you're logged in, you'll see the menu on the left, your

00:01:36.992 --> 00:01:40.757
application summary on the right, and guidance on how to upload your

00:01:40.757 --> 00:01:41.071
passport.

00:01:44.198 --> 00:01:47.843
Want to know exactly what you're paying for? Click View breakdown for

00:01:47.843 --> 00:01:49.058
a full cost summary.

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:54.269
Drag and drop, scan, or grab it from Google Drive — upload

00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:57.131
your passport and let the magic happen behind the scenes.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:03.645
No typing needed. We automatically extract your details, validate them, and cross-check

00:02:03.645 --> 00:02:08.450
everything against your eligibility — so your application is prepared for you.

00:02:10.239 --> 00:02:13.439
Once your details look good, click Continue to proceed.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:19.090
Next, click Upload to add your passport size photo — we'll validate

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.499
the format, background, and size for you.

00:02:23.312 --> 00:02:26.956
From here, just answer a few questions and upload your remaining documents

00:02:26.956 --> 00:02:27.867
the same way

00:02:29.529 --> 00:02:33.594
Next, upload the required documents based on your occupation. For example, if

00:02:33.594 --> 00:02:37.660
you're a Job Holder, you'll be asked to upload documents such as

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:38.676
your visiting card.

00:02:40.714 --> 00:02:45.098
Once you've completed your application, you'll be prompted to make your payment.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:49.481
Click Pay by Card to securely continue to Stripe, where you can

00:02:49.481 --> 00:02:53.865
enter your card details and select Pay Now. Once your payment is

00:02:53.865 --> 00:02:55.691
successful, you'll receive a confirmation.

00:02:58.008 --> 00:03:00.914
you're good to go. Your application will be ready to submit.

00:03:02.425 --> 00:03:06.462
And that's it — your application is submitted! Click Go to Dashboard

00:03:06.462 --> 00:03:08.144
to track your status anytime.

00:03:11.406 --> 00:03:15.958
That's how simple visa applications can be. Ready to offer this experience

00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:18.993
to your travellers? Visit Propellus to learn more.
